OL,3,GNEWSACourt overturns decision blocking
OL,4,AA5 road upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal has overturned a
OL,7,Fdecision that blocked work commencing
OL,8,Fon one of Northern Ireland's largest
OL,9,Fever road projects.
OL,11,FLady Chief Justice Dame Siobhan Keegan
OL,12,Fsaid a ruling by a judge in 2025
OL,13,Fblocking the work was "problematic" and
OL,14,Fcould not stand.
OL,16,FProposals to build a new A5 dual
OL,17,Fcarriageway between Londonderry and
OL,18,FAughnacloy in County Tyrone go back
OL,19,Falmost 20 years but have been beset by
OL,20,Ffunding and legal issues.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
